  "body": "The second paragraph of the [Introduction](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#introduction) states:\n\n`The Peripheral role is able to receive a single connection.`\n\nI believe this is no longer the case since the Bluetooth 4.1 spec which states in the third paragraph of page 22:\n\n`Slaves are permitted to have physical links to more than one master at a time.`\n",
